<section class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Video visits, made simple</h1>
    <p class="lede">See Ada from home, work or anywhere private in Florida. If you can make a video call with family, you can do this.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap two-col">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2 style="margin-top:0">What you'll need</h2>
      <ul class="checklist">
        <li>A smartphone, tablet or computer with a camera and microphone.</li>
        <li>A steady internet connection. Wi-Fi works best.</li>
        <li>A private, quiet space where you can talk freely.</li>
        <li>Because Ada is licensed in Florida, you'll need to be in Florida during your visit.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How to join</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>After you book, you'll receive a secure visit link by email or text from the booking platform you used.</li>
        <li>About ten minutes before your visit, open the link. On a phone, you may be asked to allow camera and microphone access; choose Allow.</li>
        <li>Wait in the virtual waiting room. Ada will bring you in when it's time.</li>
      </ol>

      <h2>If the link doesn't work</h2>
      <p>Try a different browser (Chrome or Safari work well), restart your device, or switch from cellular data to Wi-Fi. If you still can't connect, call <a href="tel:{{ callPhone | tel }}">{{ callPhone }}</a> and let us know. We'll help you get connected or reschedule.</p>

      <h2>Your privacy</h2>
      <p>Visits take place on HIPAA-compliant platforms designed for healthcare, and your information is protected under federal privacy law. Join from a private space so you can speak freely.</p>

      <h2>Visits for children and teens</h2>
      <p>A parent or guardian should join the first visit. For teens, Ada may also spend part of the visit speaking with them privately, which is a normal part of adolescent care.</p>
    </div>
    <aside class="aside">
      <h2>Need a hand getting set up?</h2>
      <p>Call before your visit and we'll walk you through it. Older adults are especially welcome to ask.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="tel:{{ callPhone | tel }}">Call {{ callPhone }}</a>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/book/">Book a visit</a>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

